  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reproductive Health and Management Support to Mnazi Mmoja Hospital Zanzibar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on request from Zanzibar and on the positive outcome of support to the physiotherapy department at Mnazi Mmoja Hospital in Zanzibar, the support to decreasing maternal mortality was approved in December. This support will also include strengthening of the hospital management including financial management mainly with an objective of system building for maternal health.</narrative>
  </description>
